  "description": "Paper | Code | Project Page\n\n  \n\n\nWelcome to the official page of the DENTEX dataset, which has been released as part of the Dental Enumeration and Diagnosis on Panoramic X-rays Challenge (DENTEX), organized in conjunction with the International Conference on Medical Image Computing and Computer-Assisted Intervention (MICCAI) in 2023. The primary objective of this challenge is to develop algorithms that can accurately detect abnormal teeth with dental enumeration and associated diagnosis. This\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ibrahimhamamci/DENTEX.",
